   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "The pronoun EN",
   "texto": [
    "**En** replaces a plugin introduced by **de** or **du/de la/de l'/des**: **Je parle de ce film** → **J'en parle**; **Je mange du pain** → **J'en mange**.",
    "It also replaces a quantity; the number is left at the end: **Tu as des frères ?** → **Oui, j'en ai deux**."
   ]
  },
